{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MEGAPLAY 是一款以使用者音樂 App 歌曲為基礎的音樂播放器，主打舒適、安全與時尚介面，適合車內播放及日常聆聽。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-271.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>車內操作與介面自訂</h2>\n<p>MEGAPLAY 支援背景播放、橫向顯示及深色主題，開啟時不會中斷正在播放的歌曲；介面配色可自訂，並提供減少歌曲標題尺寸、免費下載歌曲封面及觸控提示音。另備 MEGAWIDGET，可在通知面板快速切換歌曲，或點按歌名開啟 App，方便車內操作。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-20.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-21.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-22.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-23.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-24.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MEGAPLAY</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/megaplay/id926320613?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:02.572475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:39:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:57:51.212930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:36.933104+00:00","content_hash":"66ddcdfb5d5d840d43ecea626d338a354eacc5b44511a21fe3a93959aa12d4fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}